PUBLIC RESPONSE: {B

The ESA distribution rules are triggered whenever an employer has chosen to maintain written policies on these topics, even if the 25-employee threshold is not met; once the policies exist, every employee—including new hires—must receive a copy within 30 days of hire or any revision. B’s explicit, cost-driven refusal to provide copies therefore constitutes a continuing statutory breach on 2 January 2023.  

